# Normalize line endings to LF on checkout for files whose bytes are integrity-checked
# (plugin manifests are sha256-verified at install — CRLF drift on Windows would break
# that check) or tokenized verbatim (MG template JSX, thumbnails). Keep these LF-only
# so checkouts are byte-identical across platforms.
*.json text eol=lf
*.svg text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
